English translation of the original Japanese commit message:

fix(vad): satisfy the Rust 1.98 chunking lint in tests

Replace four constant-width chunks_exact calls with as_chunks::<N>().0
in flexaudio-vad unit tests and tests/speech_fixture.rs. Rust 1.98 added
clippy::chunks_exact_to_as_chunks, which broke CI when stable advanced.
All four changes affect test code; incomplete trailing chunks are still
ignored, so audio processing behavior is unchanged. The replacement is
compatible with the crate's declared Rust 1.91 minimum. At this point,
the CI MSRV job checked Rust 1.85 crates only and did not cover VAD.
